	(text "Port 1 powers the board. FT2232H: ch.A = MPSSE SPI -> flash/FPGA (iceprog compatible),\nch.B = UART (or MPSSE, up to 30MHz) to the FPGA for log streaming."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 25 0)
		(effects
